- **Pipeline:** build Docker image → push to Artifact Registry → `gcloud run deploy`

Every push to `main` deploys automatically. No manual steps needed.

## Platform types & display rules

The internal `type` field on cards uses these keys. Display names and icons must follow this mapping — do not deviate:

| Internal key | Display label | Icon |
|---|---|---|
| `apps_script` | **Web App** | Globe SVG (stroke `#1967D2`) |
| `workato` | **Workato** | `/workato-logo.png` (teal W) |
| `workato_ai` | **Workato AI** | 🤖 |
| `python_script` | **Python Script** | 🐍 |

- `apps_script` was renamed to "Web App" — never show "Apps Script" to users anywhere
- The Workato logo PNG lives at `public/workato-logo.png`
- Any card with `badge: 'Apps Script'` must be normalised to "Web App" at render time

## Rollback

```bash
gcloud run revisions list --service=finance-portal --region=us-east1
gcloud run services update-traffic finance-portal --region=us-east1 --to-revisions=<prev>=100
```
